      "note": "Frees the pseudoroot node without verifying that ctxt->myDoc->children still points to the pseudoroot created by this call; a nested entity parse that fails and halts the parser can leave ctxt->myDoc->children pointing to a node that was already freed or to the outer pseudoroot, causing a double-free or invalid-free"
