      "var": "list",
      "code": "xmlFreeNodeList(list);",
      "role": "sink",
      "note": "Frees the node list returned from the balanced chunk parse; if the list contains nodes that were already freed by the nested pseudoroot cleanup, this results in an invalid-free of a non-malloc'd address"
